{"sourceUrl":"https://biotech.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1472/13195.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:59.235519+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://biotech.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1472/13195.htm","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span>江南大学是教育部直属、国家</span><span>“211</span><span>工程</span><span>”</span><span>重点建设高校和一流学科建设高校。江南大学生物工程学院是我国轻工技术与工程，特别是发酵工程最具影响力和竞争力的高等教育基地之一，是我国发酵工程学科的诞生地，建立了我国第一个发酵工程国家重点学科及本硕博人才培养体系。</span><span>“</span><span>轻工技术与工程</span><span>”</span><span>一级学科在教育部第四轮全国学科评估中获评</span><span>A+</span><span>，于</span><span>2017</span><span>年入选我国首轮</span><span>“</span><span>双一流</span><span>”</span><span>建设学科，并于</span><span>2022</span><span>年进入第二轮</span><span>“</span><span>双一流</span><span>”</span><span>建设学科名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为增进优秀本科生对我院学科专业、导师的了解，吸引更多的优秀人才加入，江南大学生物工程学院将于</span>202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span>7<span>月</span></span><span>14</span><span><span>日</span>-7<span>月</span></span><span>15</span><span><span>日开展</span><span>“</span><span>全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>活动，本年度采用线上线下相结合的方式，拟接收</span><span>50</span><span>名优秀本科生线下参加、</span><span>100</span><span>名左右优秀本科生线上参加，具体事宜通知如下。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>、</span></span><span><span>全国各高</span></span><span><span>校</span></span><span><span>相关学科的</span></span><span><span>优秀三年级本科生（</span>2026<span>年毕业）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>、品德优良、遵纪守法、身心健康、诚实守信、学风端正，无考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其它违法违纪受处分记录；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3<span>、学习成绩优秀，本科期间综合表现优异；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4<span>、英语水平良好；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5<span>、有志于从事学术研究，有较强的科研能力或科研潜力；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>6<span>、能够在本科所在学校取得推荐免试研究生资格者优先。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请流程及审核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>、网上申请</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>请有报名意向的学生在江南大学研究生招生信息网</span><span>“</span><span>夏令营报名系统</span><span>”</span><span>填报申请信息，网址：</span></span><span>http://yzgmis.jiangnan.edu.cn/zsgl2025/xlygl/</span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>申请材料须如实填写和提供。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>网上报名时间：</span>202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span>6<span>月</span></span><span>27</span><span><span>日</span>--202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span>3<span>日。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>、参加方式意愿填报</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>请报名的学生扫描下方二维码，填写</span></span><span><span>调查问卷</span></span><span><span>，确定自己</span></span><span><span>参加方式。夏令营优秀营员评选线上线下采用统一标准</span></span><span><span>，参与形式不影响优秀营员评选结果。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>意愿填报网址：</span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/PQufMgJ.aspx# </span></p>\n<p><span><span>填报时间：</span>202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span>6<span>月</span></span><span>27</span><span><span>日</span>--202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span>3<span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://biotech.jiangnan.edu.cn/__local/6/86/79/5599D29E2EAB02985BF856F8952_3206346A_E22A.png\"/> </p>\n<p><span>3<span>、资格审核</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>日前由学院确定线上和线下入选名单，请及时登录申请系统查询，入选营员须在</span>7<span>月</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>日前确认是否参加，逾期未确认视放弃此资格；届时未接到入选通知的同学皆为未入选者，恕不另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、活动安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>7<span>月</span></span><span>13</span><span><span>日：营员报到；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7<span>月</span></span><span>14</span><span><span>日：开营仪式、学术讲座、校园参观；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7<span>月</span></span><span>15</span><span><span>日：</span></span><span><span>师生交流</span></span><span><span>、研本交流、闭营仪式。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>详细安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、营员考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院根据营员申请材料</span></span><span><span>及</span></span><span><span>师生交流</span></span><span><span>表现</span></span><span><span>选拔出优秀营员，颁发优秀营员证书。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、其他</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>、夏令营期间，我院统一安排用餐、外校营员在无锡的住宿；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>、往返路费由个人承担；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3<span>、参加暑期夏令营的营员必须按照统一的安排全程参加夏令营活动，擅自缺席活动者，将无法获得结业证书。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>欢迎有意向报考我院研究生的全国各地同学积极参加本次夏令营活动！</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人电话：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>0510-85321631 </span><span><span>孙</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"https://biotech.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1472/13195.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>biotech_yj@jiangnan.edu.cn</span></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span>                                                                                                                                    <span>江南大学生物工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>                                                                                 202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span>6<span>月</span></span><span>24</span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"80643803143cfc225a79cb8dd3225bd3ee1115fd1575cc8ba6bea9b6fcda331f","textLength":1199,"sourceSha256":"7d23d1d4caf60648d5efedac579f8f265c474c333411330f3a18f18df30f9119","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5c9b067add671c4715e7","title":"2025年江南大学生物工程学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:59.235519+00:00"}
